_Coding to generate hash (show in report):_
def hash_points(points, salt):
    data = str(points) + salt
    return hashlib.sha256(data.encode()).hexdigest()
    # Input: [[120,200],[250,180],[400,300]] -> Output: a8f3c9e1...
*SCREENSHOT 3: LOGIN PAGE - SUCCESS*
